WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.596
Welcome to Propellus. Today, we’re showing you how SmartBridge replaces tedious manual

00:00:05.596 --> 00:00:11.192
copying and pasting with instant data fetching—allowing agents to process Thailand e-Visas

00:00:11.192 --> 00:00:16.787
seamlessly in seconds. Beyond Thailand, any country that has an e visa

00:00:16.787 --> 00:00:22.383
can be added to SmartBridge. This saves valuable time, cuts operational costs,

00:00:22.383 --> 00:00:24.715
and completely eliminates manual errors.

00:00:27.242 --> 00:00:30.965
let's get signed in. Just drop in your email and password, and

00:00:30.965 --> 00:00:34.689
click that Sign In button. In seconds, you're inside your agency's command

00:00:34.689 --> 00:00:34.999
center!

00:00:35.962 --> 00:00:41.258
welcome to your Dashboard! every order, every status, every SLA deadline, tracked

00:00:41.258 --> 00:00:43.464
live. No spreadsheets, no digging.

00:00:44.431 --> 00:00:49.062
Under Order Fulfillment, all visa applications are organized automatically. From here, agents

00:00:49.062 --> 00:00:53.308
can simply click on an order to access the traveler's details

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:59.102
Let's select this specific order. We'll use this applicant's profile to demonstrate

00:00:59.102 --> 00:01:03.824
how SmartBridge seamlessly fetches and populates data into the Thai e-Visa Official

00:01:03.824 --> 00:01:04.611
website portal.

00:01:05.478 --> 00:01:11.055
Here, you can review the applicant's complete profile and uploaded documents. Instead

00:01:11.055 --> 00:01:16.631
of copying this information line-by-line into the e-Visa portal, SmartBridge extracts and

00:01:16.631 --> 00:01:20.349
syncs all this data automatically—eliminating manual entry entirely

00:01:21.527 --> 00:01:25.587
Once the application is reviewed, clicking Smart Bridge connects directly to the

00:01:25.587 --> 00:01:26.940
official government e-visa site.

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:31.962
Next, enter your credentials and CAPTCHA, then click Sign In to authenticate

00:01:31.962 --> 00:01:34.300
your access to the Thai e-Visa portal

00:01:35.222 --> 00:01:39.859
After landing on your portal dashboard, hit 'Run. SmartBridge takes over right

00:01:39.859 --> 00:01:42.177
away to start processing the application.

00:01:43.131 --> 00:01:48.059
SmartBridge automatically pulls applicant details and populates every single form field for

00:01:48.059 --> 00:01:52.987
you—saving time, cutting operational costs, and eliminating manual errors. Plus, any country

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:57.916
with an e-visa system can be seamlessly added to SmartBridge. And as

00:01:57.916 --> 00:02:02.844
you can see, the entire form was filled within just one minute!

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:11.018
Once the data is fetched, you can head back to the dashboard.

00:02:11.018 --> 00:02:15.655
Here, your auto-populated application is fully accessible—giving agents complete control to review,

00:02:15.655 --> 00:02:17.974
edit, or delete details whenever needed.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:24.375
Transform your visa processing with 10x operational efficiency. Visit Propellus today to

00:02:24.375 --> 00:02:28.024
see how Propellus SmartBridge can power your business.
